      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "From a technical level, a few things to consider. Are you asking to be able to raise the limit, or only modify it to values at and below what the world Creator sets? I'm going to use the fishing world add the example of this, the max population for an instance today is 25. So to rephrase my question, are you asking for the ability to set a limit of like say 2-25, or do you want to be able to go higher? \n\nBut the more important question is if you're asking to change the cap while the instance is live, or only at instance creation?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
